  "body_html": "<p>Celebrate your love for baseball with a custom-made Jeminise baseball blanket, designed to bring warmth and joy to any fan. This cozy throw is perfect for gifting to your favorite player or enthusiast, making every moment feel special and cherished.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize with the name and number of your favorite baseball player to create a unique and cherished item.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Feel:</strong> Made from Sherpa and Fleece fabric with two polyester layers, ensuring a super soft, lightweight, and comfortable experience.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in four convenient sizes: Small (40x30 inches), Medium (50x40 inches), Large (60x50 inches), and X-Large (80x60 inches).</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift:</strong> An ideal present for men, women, moms, dads, and baseball players for occasions like Valentine's, Mother's Day, Father's Day, and Christmas.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water; air dry without heat for best results, maintaining its fluffiness and vibrant color.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Durable Material:</strong> Constructed with long-lasting color ink and high-quality polyester fabric for enduring appeal.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Baseball Design 02</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Small (40x30 inches), Medium (50x40 inches), Large (60x50 inches), X-Large (80x60 inches)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Size</th>\n<td>60\"L x 50\"W</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Sport</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Breathable, Lightweight</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine wash separately in cold water, air dry without heat</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
